-- with `ouroctl replay <log> examples/documents --records <file>`. `base`
-- opens three notes, edits and saves two of them (each write takes 35-50
-- ms) and makes one invalid edit; `error` continues with a save whose
-- write fails (ENOSPC); `stuck` continues with two more saves, the last of
-- which never finishes. One section 10 record per line.
